{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49345","headline":"女冠子 二 · 牛峤","name":"女冠子 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦江烟水，卓女烧春浓美。\n小檀霞，绣带芙蓉帐，金钗芍药花。\n额黄侵腻发，臂钏透红纱。\n柳暗莺啼处，认郎家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}